          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">Spells of Coming Forth by Day; the Weighing of the Heart in Spell 125; the Negative Confession; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/osiris">Osiris</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anubis">Anubis</a> and Ammit the Devourer; the Field of Reeds; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/papyrus">Papyrus</a> of Ani</span></div>
